"""A local detector of prepositional complements, especially spatial ones.

It recognizes token-sized location words, calendar terms, and listed fixed
expressions such as 'in order' and 'of course'. Strength varies by phrase;
articles weaken idiomatic readings. Unlisted complements receive only a
small baseline. These constructions repeatedly peaked in training examples.
